402 Q3. OpenVPN Full Tunnel

403 Commands

{

404 apt install openvpn easy-rsa -y

405 Does: Installs OpenVPN.

406 echo "net.ipv4.ip_forward=1" >> /etc/sysctl.conf 407 sysctl -p

408 Does: Enables routing through VPN server.

409 Server Configuration

410 push "redirect-gateway def1 bypass-dhcp"

411 Does: Sends all client internet traffic through VPN.

412 push "dhcp-option DNS 8.8.8.8"

413 push "dhcp-option DNS 8.8.4.4"

414 Does: Pushes DNS settings to clients.

415 compress lz4

416 push "compress 1z4"

417 Does: Enables VPN compression.

418 NAT

419 iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING \

420 -s 10.8.0.0/24 -o etho \

421 -j MASQUERADE

422 Does: Allows VPN clients to access the Internet.

423 Start Service

424 systemctl start openvpn-server@server 425 systemctl enable openvpn-server@server

426 Does: Starts OpenVPN automatically.
